flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> route
    route -->|document| retrieve
    route -->|time| call_tools
    route -->|side_effect| approve
    route -->|smalltalk / out_of_scope| finalize
    retrieve -->|usable context| generate
    retrieve -->|empty / weak / error| finalize
    call_tools --> finalize
    generate --> critique
    critique -->|accept| finalize
    critique -->|fix and iterations < 3| generate
    critique -->|fallback or iterations = 3| finalize
    approve -.->|interrupt: persist and pause| HUMAN[Human: approved boolean + action_id]
    HUMAN -.->|Command resume| approve
    approve -->|approved = true| call_side_effect
    approve -->|false / invalid| finalize
    call_side_effect -->|idempotent local SQLite write / error| finalize
    finalize --> END([END])
